---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import {campgrounds} from '../lib/content';const camps=await campgrounds();
---
<Base title="Photo credits and licenses"><div class="container"><div class="page-intro"><h1>Photo credits and licenses</h1><p>Park landscape images are sourced from Wikimedia Commons under the licenses below. They are not original trip photographs and do not show a verified individual campsite. Files may be resized and cropped in the page layout. Original field-note illustrations are created for this publication.</p></div><div class="prose section photo-credits"><section><h2>Original banner artwork</h2><p>The sunset lake banner on the home page and morning forest banner on the campground directory were generated with OpenAI image generation for Campground Weekend on October 27, 2026. These are fictional editorial scenes, not photographs of a named park or verified campsite. Resized and cropped for responsive display.</p></section>{camps.filter(c=>c.data.image).map(c=><section><h2>{c.data.name}</h2><p>{c.data.image!.caption}</p><p>{c.data.image!.author} · <a href={c.data.image!.licenseUrl}>{c.data.image!.license}</a> · <a href={c.data.image!.file}>Original file and full attribution</a>. {c.data.image!.modified}</p></section>)}</div></div></Base>
